                h2.section-title 👋🏾 Hi, I'm Ollie.
                p I am a web developer and digital product specialist with over 15 years of experience building accessible, user-focused websites and digital platforms. My work sits at the intersection of software development, UX, and product strategy, with a strong emphasis on clarity, performance, and long-term maintainability.
                p I’ve led frontend teams, collaborated closely with designers and stakeholders, and delivered robust digital products for <strong>arts organisations, cultural institutions, public-sector bodies, and purpose-led teams.</strong> From custom WordPress builds and complex system integrations to API-driven services, I focus on making complex systems simple, resilient, and genuinely useful.
                p I care deeply about <strong>accessibility, inclusive design, and building things that work well for real people.</strong> My approach is grounded in user needs, clear outcomes, and sustainable delivery, ensuring digital work continues to create value long after launch.
                p Alongside hands-on development, I studied <strong>Product Management at King’s College London, graduating with distinction.</strong> This strengthened my practice around digital strategy, prioritisation, stakeholder alignment, and delivering the right things at the right time.
                p.small <i>* Outside of this I'm a keen musician and have a few projects I am involved in 🎸. Feel free to ask me more if this is your kinda thing!</i>

